    "reviews": "\u201cWith thousands of players fighting on a single server, Foxhole is everything I want an MMO to be.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cI enjoyed Foxhole, and I know much of that enjoyment grew out the marvel of watching so many players working together.\u201d<br>IGN<br><br>\u201cThis was the first time that I felt like I was playing in a war: it was both entertaining and surreal.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br>",
